# nv_nv1_sph_ltcP_ng without the contact model (CONTACT_NO_TENSION 0; user 10-06: not needed, not trusted --
# GIZMO manages the rings without one). Bodies interact like any particle pair. Single-body tests (waves, A1)
# are bit-identical to nv_nv1_sph_ltcP_ng (the flag only edits pairs of different bodies).
RECON_FACE_DV 0
NUM_VISC 1
NUM_VISC_L 1.
NUM_VISC_T 1.
ART_VISC 0
TENSILE_CORRECTION 1
GNOG_PENALTY 0
ELASTIC_FACE_MODE 2
STRESS_2D_GIZMO 1
STRESS_RATE_RAW_GRAD 1
CONTACT_NO_TENSION 0
ELASTIC_WORK_SIGN_FIX 1
MATERIAL_VISCOSITY 0
EXPLICIT_VOL_SPH_DIVV 1
TENSILE_CORRECTION_LOCAL 1
TENSILE_CORRECTION_POWER 1.
TENSILE_CORRECTION_DAMP 0.
TC_TOTAL_STRESS_GATE 0
TENSILE_CORRECTION_PREFAC 5.0
TENSILE_CORRECTION_FMAX 10.0
